{
  "an4.87:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 4.87 ",
  "an4.87:0.2": "9. Confirmed ",
  "an4.87:0.3": "The Son ",
  "an4.87:1.1": "“Mendicants, these four individuals are found in the world. ",
  "an4.87:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.87:1.3": "The confirmed ascetic, the white lotus ascetic, the pink lotus ascetic, and the delicate ascetic of ascetics. ",
  "an4.87:2.1": "And how is an individual a confirmed ascetic? ",
  "an4.87:2.2": "It’s when a mendicant is a practicing trainee, ",
  "an4.87:2.3": "who lives aspiring to the supreme sanctuary from the yoke. ",
  "an4.87:2.4": "It’s like the eldest son of an anointed aristocratic king. He has not yet been anointed, but is eligible, and has been confirmed in the succession. ",
  "an4.87:2.5": "In the same way, a mendicant is a practicing trainee, who lives aspiring to the supreme sanctuary from the yoke. ",
  "an4.87:2.6": "That’s how an individual is a confirmed ascetic. ",
  "an4.87:3.1": "And how is an individual a white lotus ascetic? ",
  "an4.87:3.2": "It’s when a mendicant realizes the undefiled freedom of heart and freedom by wisdom. And they live having realized it with their own insight in this very life due to the ending of defilements. But they don’t have direct meditative experience of the eight liberations. ",
  "an4.87:3.3": "That’s how an individual is a white lotus ascetic. ",
  "an4.87:4.1": "And how is an individual a pink lotus ascetic? ",
  "an4.87:4.2": "It’s when a mendicant realizes the undefiled freedom of heart and freedom by w